@startuml overview
title Wake-up run
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Waiting
Waiting : wake time = earlier of\n(first event - lead time, alarm setting)
Waiting --> Ringing : wake time
Ringing --> Briefing : alarm sound length elapsed,\nor out of bed in the first round
Briefing --> Interval : briefing done, still in bed
Interval --> Ringing : still in bed after interval\n(louder, up to the limit)
Briefing --> Watching : out of bed\n(the first briefing is read to the end)
Ringing --> Watching : out of bed in a snooze round
Interval --> Watching : out of bed
Watching : back-to-bed window (default 30 min)
Watching --> BackInBed : in bed
BackInBed : back-in-bed grace (default 5 min)
BackInBed --> Watching : out of bed within the grace
BackInBed --> Ringing : still in bed after the grace\n(louder than before)
Watching --> [*] : back-to-bed window elapsed
@enduml
